---
description: Indent and line-length conventions for this repo
globs: "**/*.{ts,js,mjs,cjs,json}"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Formatting

- Indent with 4 spaces, never 2
- Do not wrap lines to 80 or 100 characters. Keep statements on one line unless a break is required for syntax or readability of a long chained expression
- Print width is effectively unlimited (Prettier `printWidth: 999`)
